TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Yo! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bayağı forma girmiş görünüyorsun!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Aynen!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Demek antrenman işe yarıyor!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Bugün birine
ilham vermeyi
umuyordum,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} sana denk gelmesine sevindim,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Ich hab hier ein
Geschenk für dich.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Einfach so,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
als Zeichen meiner Freundschaft.

ES:
¡Oye, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Apunté tu nombre en una rifa.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Y has ganado esto!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Hay que ver, ¡qué suerte!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
¡Aquí tienes!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I thought you'd want to have this,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
so I went ahead and bought it for
you, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Don't say anything!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Just take it!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bunu isteyeceğini düşündüm,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} o yüzden gidip
senin için aldım, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hiçbir şey söyleme!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Sadece al!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non mi aspetto niente in cambio.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sì, sto parlando seriamente,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
